  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8cfc9115-fa6e-418d-9885-ee3556e45b2c.png\" alt=\"galosphere\" width=\"850\" height=\"438\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_2014cae8-e980-448a-ae26-71aa1dbe2c1c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_60d8a93e-e582-44bd-a3ce-d1fd4060d699.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgalosphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_66523eaa-30a9-4917-91fe-6b285214aa0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fOrcinusWasTaken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_d02d553b-ab4f-492f-bc41-d94c2699505d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_45b4c79a-5c20-4617-86a0-451eeb134516.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📘：整體概覽</strong></span></p>\n<p>Galosphere 是一款旨在透過新增全新內容（如新的生物群系、遊戲機制、生物等）來改善地下世界的模組。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📝：注意事項</strong></span></p>\n<p>本模組已支援 Forge、NeoForge 與 Fabric。Galosphere 是一款旨在透過新增全新內容（如新的生物群系、遊戲機制、生物等）來改善地下世界的模組。</p>\n<p>如果您對本模組有任何建議，歡迎加入我的 Discord 伺服器以了解更多資訊。&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🧰：整合包設計者</strong></span></p>\n<p>您可以將此模組放入您的整合包中，但請務必標明我們的開發團隊！&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>💎：部分功能特色</strong></span></p>\n<p>水晶峽谷</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_eb0b2eef-05a0-4186-ac0c-2e00fad7631d.png\" alt=\"crystal_canyons\" width=\"850\" height=\"291\"></p>\n<p><strong><em>水晶峽谷</em></strong>&nbsp;包含兩種新寶石——<strong>Allurite 與 Lumiere</strong>，它們會在該生物群系中形成巨大的結晶結構。探索時，您還能發現<strong>Sparkles</strong>，它們的背上可以生長 Allurite 與 Lumiere！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_c07a97ae-936a-4ce3-8749-f071bc888889.png\" alt=\"p_crystal_canyons\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>地衣洞穴</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8e32f1c5-d999-44d2-ba60-4ca5729b61df.png\" alt=\"lichen_caves\" width=\"850\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><strong>地衣洞穴</strong> 長滿了<strong>地衣苔蘚</strong>和巨型蘑菇。您可以在該生物群系周圍看到小<strong>幽靈（Spectres）</strong>平靜地飛翔並遊歷。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_13a3ba2e-03fe-424e-a308-a0a6b91bf45f.png\" alt=\"p_lichen_caves\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>粉紅鹽洞</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_2e0906c1-4c79-4b51-9030-1b3a26e153a6.png\" alt=\"pink_salt_caves\" width=\"850\" height=\"422\"></p>\n<p><strong>粉紅鹽洞</strong> 覆蓋著粉紅色、玫瑰色與淡粉色的鹽。在探索這個特殊的生物群系時，您可能會意外發現一些神秘的<strong>古代神龕</strong>……</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8bb0f6b5-06bc-4958-b155-58d1fc23199e.png\" alt=\"p_pink_salt_caves\" width=\"850\" height=\"326\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>遺忘廢墟</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_f2275f3a-0c3e-4a59-86e1-831ad7a8a77b.png\" alt=\"forgotten_ruins\" width=\"850\" height=\"326\"></p>\n<p><strong>遺忘廢墟</strong> 是一種罕見的<strong>地下結構</strong>，內部充滿了供您刷除的<strong>可疑方塊</strong>。您甚至會遇到一些<strong>鼴鼠</strong>，它們會提供一些小<strong>支線任務</strong>供您在旅途中完成。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_59b1d7d4-8ec5-4262-8aba-98fdf2a1df45.png\" alt=\"p_forgotten_ruins_1\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8429e5a0-1ca8-4bc1-ab3b-27384386ccd9.png\" alt=\"p_forgotten_ruins_2\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📺： <strong>模組預覽</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:614px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vxodY0zYmZE\" width=\"607\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ajl3DW2PjGo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RRmG0DUYOYI?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/en8u3KcWUPU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xpVSGRDQLcc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></h3>\n</div>\n<p><img></p>",
